{"id":"8e071baceea3f74c","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-reflection-principle.md","title":"Local Reflection Forces Essential Infinitude","display":"thm-reflection-principle — Local Reflection Forces Essential Infinitude","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-reflection-principle","aliases":["67-thm-reflection-principle"],"display":"thm-reflection-principle — Local Reflection Forces Essential Infinitude","depends_on":["[[67-df-local-reflection]]","[[67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]","[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":4,"source_label":"Theorem 1","source_printed_pages":"52","source_pdf_pages":"63","source_proof_status":"Theorem 4.1 陈述及短证明已核对；所用标准演绎定理算术化沿用原书接口"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-reflection-principle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-reflection-principle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reflection-principle — Local Reflection Forces Essential Infinitude"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bfe810351301dc7b\" href=\"?note=bfe810351301dc7b\" title=\"67-df-local-reflection\">67-df-local-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fea02b696529d019\" href=\"?note=fea02b696529d019\" title=\"67-df-bounded-axiomatizability\">67-df-bounded-axiomatizability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"52"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"63"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Theorem 4.1 陈述及短证明已核对；所用标准演绎定理算术化沿用原书接口"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 为一致原始递归公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T\">\\(Q\\subseteq T\\)</span>，采用固定自然证明算术化。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bfe810351301dc7b\" href=\"?note=bfe810351301dc7b\" title=\"67-df-local-reflection\">67-df-local-reflection</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fea02b696529d019\" href=\"?note=fea02b696529d019\" title=\"67-df-bounded-axiomatizability\">67-df-bounded-axiomatizability</a>。固定点使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\\ T\\vdash\\rho\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)\\ T\\vdash\\rho\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>恢复原书 Theorem 4.1；旧条目只有对反思实例应用 modus ponens 的命题重述。</p>\n<p>来源短证明已读：若一致扩张可用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+\\theta\">\\(S+\\theta\\)</span> 公理化，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{S+\\theta}(\\overline{g(\\psi)})\">\\(Q\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{S+\\theta}(\\overline{g(\\psi)})\\)</span>。局部反思中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\to\\psi\">\\(\\theta\\to\\psi\\)</span> 的实例与形式化演绎定理推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S+\\theta\\vdash\\psi\">\\(S+\\theta\\vdash\\psi\\)</span>；逐数证明可表示性又给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_{S+\\theta}(\\overline{g(\\psi)})\">\\(Q\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_{S+\\theta}(\\overline{g(\\psi)})\\)</span>，推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\psi\">\\(\\neg\\psi\\)</span>，矛盾。对每个扩张复用该论证即为本质无限。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-local-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"bfe810351301dc7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-local-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-bounded-axiomatizability","status":"resolved","id":"fea02b696529d019","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f76c99f69499336d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-local-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"bfe810351301dc7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)$ 取 [[67-df-local-reflection]]；$\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)$ 取 [[67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]。固定点使用 [[67-thm-fixed-po